1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:08,000
Hello everyone, before this course begins, let me introduce you to CLO Ecosystem.

2
00:00:08,000 --> 00:00:13,000
CLO Ecosystem is the ecosystem of CLO.

3
00:00:13,000 --> 00:00:20,000
CLO Virtual Fashion Company is creating a new ecosystem for digital fashion.

4
00:00:20,000 --> 00:00:31,000
Through the integration of clothing design software such as CLO, Marvelous Designer and Genie, and Closet and Connect, we focus on the content of the clothing platform,

5
00:00:31,000 --> 00:00:38,000
deeply involved in clothing from design development to production and promotion of the entire process.

6
00:00:38,000 --> 00:00:43,000
To build an efficient and sustainable workflow.

7
00:00:43,000 --> 00:00:49,000
In this video, I will explain the basic concepts of CLO, Closet and Connect,

8
00:00:49,000 --> 00:00:56,000
and describe its basic workflow, and show their applications in the process.

9
00:00:56,000 --> 00:01:02,000
First, I will explain what CLO is, and what its main function is.

10
00:01:02,000 --> 00:01:06,000
CLO is a software based on 3D clothing sewing technology.

11
00:01:06,000 --> 00:01:13,000
It provides efficient virtual clothing solution by digitalizing clothing design, production and marketing, and so on.

12
00:01:13,000 --> 00:01:18,000
By using CLO, users can maximize their creativity,

13
00:01:18,000 --> 00:01:19,000
improve productivity,

14
00:01:19,000 --> 00:01:21,000
and increase their productivity.

15
00:01:21,000 --> 00:01:26,000
This plays an important role in the digital transformation of the clothing industry.

16
00:01:26,000 --> 00:01:29,000
Next, I will introduce the main functions of CLO.

17
00:01:29,000 --> 00:01:34,000
One of the main functions of CLO is to be able to make clothes in real time,

18
00:01:34,000 --> 00:01:39,000
and can quickly and accurately achieve the design structure of the clothing effect,

19
00:01:39,000 --> 00:01:43,000
and can react in real time to change the fabric,

20
00:01:43,000 --> 00:01:46,000
and adjust the effect after the clothing version.

21
00:01:46,000 --> 00:01:48,000
In addition, in the design stage,

22
00:01:48,000 --> 00:01:52,000
CLO can effectively adjust the design of clothing color and style,

23
00:01:52,000 --> 00:01:56,000
and create 3D clothing samples to replace real samples,

24
00:01:56,000 --> 00:01:59,000
thereby saving production time and cost.

25
00:01:59,000 --> 00:02:05,000
Finally, the 3D clothing created in CLO can be applied in various fields,

26
00:02:05,000 --> 00:02:07,000
such as electronic business content,

27
00:02:07,000 --> 00:02:13,000
and provide more possibilities for digital clothing creation applications.

28
00:02:13,000 --> 00:02:15,000
Next is Closet.

29
00:02:15,000 --> 00:02:17,000
Closet is a cloud-based platform.

30
00:02:17,000 --> 00:02:21,000
You can upload and manage your 3D assets here,

31
00:02:21,000 --> 00:02:26,000
and can share and communicate with internal and external teams.

32
00:02:30,000 --> 00:02:36,000
One of the main functions of Closet is to be able to use multi-layer file structure.

33
00:02:37,000 --> 00:02:41,000
This structure can be more efficient in file management.

34
00:02:41,000 --> 00:02:46,000
You can set the corresponding layer structure according to the needs of different organizations,

35
00:02:46,000 --> 00:02:51,000
such as companies, brands, product lines, developers, and studios,

36
00:02:51,000 --> 00:02:56,000
and manage and share your 3D resources in different layers.

37
00:02:56,000 --> 00:03:01,000
In addition, you can also store digital assets in Closet,

38
00:03:01,000 --> 00:03:04,000
upload various file formats,

39
00:03:04,000 --> 00:03:07,000
in addition to the 3D file format shown in the picture,

40
00:03:07,000 --> 00:03:15,000
including documents such as DXF, Adobe Illustrator, Excel, and PDF.

41
00:03:15,000 --> 00:03:19,000
Closet is also a platform that is easy to communicate with.

42
00:03:19,000 --> 00:03:23,000
In the process of style design, color modification, and other suggestions,

43
00:03:23,000 --> 00:03:28,000
you can share your thoughts with the internal or external team on the platform,

44
00:03:28,000 --> 00:03:33,000
communicate with each other, and obtain more accurate and timely feedback.

45
00:03:36,000 --> 00:03:42,000
Finally, by using various tools such as online process list and material list,

46
00:03:42,000 --> 00:03:46,000
you can systematically manage the entire production process of the product,

47
00:03:46,000 --> 00:03:49,000
and achieve efficient workflow.

48
00:03:50,000 --> 00:03:53,000
