53
00:04:07,000 --> 00:04:09,000
display and sell,

54
00:04:09,000 --> 00:04:15,000
and the face-to-face supplier will also upload their digitalized products here.

55
00:04:17,000 --> 00:04:19,000
First of all, in the shop category,

56
00:04:19,000 --> 00:04:24,000
you can easily obtain all the materials needed for digital clothing creation,

57
00:04:24,000 --> 00:04:30,000
and you can also use the 3D resources created by Closet to make a profit.

58
00:04:32,000 --> 00:04:34,000
