62
00:04:45,000 --> 00:04:49,000
The competition is regularly held by fashion brands and Closet.

63
00:04:49,000 --> 00:04:54,000
The space for the competition is only to provide the creators with opportunities to show themselves,

64
00:04:54,000 --> 00:04:57,000
