65
00:04:57,000 --> 00:05:01,000
Designers can gain industry recognition through the competition,

66
00:05:01,000 --> 00:05:03,000
expand their career path,

67
00:05:03,000 --> 00:05:06,000
and make contributions to the development of digital fashion.

68
00:05:08,000 --> 00:05:10,000
In the application section,

69
00:05:10,000 --> 00:05:12,000
