98
00:06:38,000 --> 00:06:41,000
It combines creativity and fashion perfectly.

99
00:06:42,000 --> 00:06:48,000
The above has introduced the overall concept and main functions of Closet and Connect.

100
00:06:49,000 --> 00:06:53,000
